		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7E09D93FD685B52D"]
			description: [
				"Wise Grisha, how do I create a living catalyst with this heart I obtained?"
				""
				"&4If you dip it into the pool of etheric blood that reaches into hell, I believe there would be a reaction."
				""
				"Raw?"
				""
				"&4Temper it first. Merge it with some mystical flesh and etheric crystals first. It's no longer connected to the rest of a flesh gargantuan after all."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "3142ECB14BD0600D"
			rewards: [
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
					id: "44C057F9E2686D0C"
					table_id: 6565141144447489233L
					type: "choice"
				}
				{
					id: "0FB9E3E10E753F94"
					type: "xp_levels"
					xp_levels: 1
				}
			]
			tasks: [{
				id: "0E6A8CA43D458267"
				item: "biomancy:primordial_core"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 1.5d
			y: -11.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"1149E9D781B1E0E6"
				"3142ECB14BD0600D"
			]
			dependency_requirement: "one_started"
			description: [
				"I can create my own flesh dungeon now! This once beating heart will beat again and obey my command! It will spawn flesh abominations that I will be able to use myself.."
				""
				"With ample flesh, this creature will grow!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&4This is an abomination!"
				""
				"Jealous? I know you're not as great as my flesh baby-"
				""
				"&4No! It's going to keep spreading and infecting the entire world with flesh! What have you done?"
				""
				"What? No! I have it all under perfect control! In fact, I believe if I feed it some rotten flesh and healing potions, it can grow a lot more!"
				""
				"&4No!"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "681EF488E543DB48"
			rewards: [
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
