		{
			dependencies: ["1B89069CF6F1DCC1"]
			description: [
				"With this sickle, I can now harvest more specialized and dangerous organs from all sorts of creatures."
				""
				"If I slay various creatures, I can harvest different organs. Predators such as wolves or cats will yield sharp claws and fangs. I can obtain bone marrow from skeletons, volatile glands from explosive creatures and toxic glands from poisonous or venomous creatures. Sinews and bile glands are quite common among living creatures."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&4I sure wouldn't enjoy being despoiled myself!"
				""
				"What would happen if I used this sickle on you?"
				""
				"&4Nothing! I'm made of paper and leather! I just so happen to be sentient!"
				""
				"You have.. no internal organs?"
				""
				"&4Nothing! I am powered by sheer willpower and magic!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Say, would human villages have these ingredients somewhere?"
				""
				"&4Surely. Elite hunters have the capabilities to harvest these ingredients and they must offload it somewhere."
				""
				"Then, would I be able to manufacture these?"
				""
				"&4I beg your pardon?"
			]
